[2], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "Int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 模式选择：\n# 1.tiny（默认）：速度快; \n\n## 2.full：质量高，速度慢\n\n## 3.scale（放大倍数）：一般选2倍，4倍显存会爆\n\n## 4.color_fix（颜色修复）：\n\n## 5.tiled_vae（VAE分块解码）：启用后能降低显存占用，但会降速。\n\n## 6.tiled_dit（DiT分块计算）：启用后能降低显存占用，但会降速。\n\n## 7.tile_size /tile_overlap（分块大小与重叠）：\n控制输入视频在推理时的分块方式。\n\n## 8.unload_dit（卸载DiT模型）：\n解码前卸载DiT模型以降低速度占用。\n\n# 9.local_range(参考上下文)\nlocal_range 值越大：同时处理的帧数越高，显存占用越高。\nlocal_range 值越小：同时处理的帧数越低，显存占用越低，速度也更快。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [399.38128662109375, 460.0440673828125], "pos": [-1231.0029296875, 616.0225219726562], "id": 23, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n## local_range 值越大：同时处理的帧数越高，显存占用越高。\n## local_range 值越小：同时处理的帧数越低，显存占用越低，速度也更快。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [277.8831481933594, 132.56240844726562], "pos": [-2185.916748046875, 800.4534912109375], "id": 29, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [32], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-2186.1181640625, 690.0164794921875], "widgets_values": [9], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 28, "type": "Int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.28.7", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [2419.479436755691,